Z||000004||MickeyAsh||12-14-2001||12:38 AM||||Sweet. All problems are solved anyway, the guy who sold it to me just replied to my email, confirming the fact that the engine is indeed a Y. YAY! ::snatches up 4T80E:: Project time!!||||reg||1
